{"batch_id": "fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c", "chunk_number": 0, "extracted_graph_data": {"entities": [{"id": "lupo_1", "type": "Character", "properties": {"name": "lupo", "description": "The wolf, an antagonist in the story."}}, {"id": "nonna_1", "type": "Character", "properties": {"name": "nonna", "description": "The grandmother, a character in the story."}}, {"id": "cappuccetto_1", "type": "Character", "properties": {"name": "cappuccetto", "description": "Little Red Riding Hood, a character in the story."}}, {"id": "casa_nonna_1", "type": "Location", "properties": {"name": "casa della nonna", "description": "The grandmother's house, also referred to as 'casetta nel bosco'."}}, {"id": "strada_lunga_1", "type": "Location", "properties": {"name": "strada pi\u00f9 lunga", "description": "The longer road."}}, {"id": "nocciole_1", "type": "Item", "properties": {"name": "nocciole", "description": "Hazelnuts."}}, {"id": "fiorellini_1", "type": "Item", "properties": {"name": "fiorellini", "description": "Small flowers."}}, {"id": "porta_1", "type": "Object", "properties": {"name": "porta", "description": "The door of the grandmother's house."}}, {"id": "succo_frutta_1", "type": "Item", "properties": {"name": "succo di frutta", "description": "Fruit juice."}}, {"id": "focaccia_1", "type": "Item", "properties": {"name": "focaccia", "description": "Focaccia bread."}}, {"id": "catenaccio_1", "type": "Object", "properties": {"name": "catenaccio", "description": "The latch of the door."}}, {"id": "chiavistello_1", "type": "Object", "properties": {"name": "chiavistello", "description": "The bolt of the door."}}, {"id": "camera_nonna_1", "type": "Location", "properties": {"name": "camera della nonnina", "description": "The grandmother's bedroom."}}, {"id": "letto_1", "type": "Object", "properties": {"name": "letto", "description": "The bed."}}, {"id": "voce_bambina_1", "type": "Concept", "properties": {"name": "voce della bambina", "description": "The voice of the little girl (Little Red Riding Hood)."}}, {"id": "chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Chunk", "properties": {"original_text": "cos\u00ec prese una scorciatoia e corse a casa della nonna, mentre cappuccetto proseguiva per la strada pi\u00f9 lunga con molta calma, raccogliendo nocciole e fiorellini da portare alla nonna. quando il lupo arriv\u00f2 alla casetta nel bosco buss\u00f2 alla porta: \u00abtoc, toc!\u00bb \u2013 chi \u00e8? \u2013 rispose la nonnina. \u2013 sono io nonnina, cappuccetto rosso \u2013 disse il lupo imitando la voce della bambina \u2013 ti porto succo di frutta e focaccia, apri la porta. \u2013 tira il catenaccio e la porta si aprir\u00e0 \u2013 grid\u00f2 la nonna \u2013 io son troppo debole e non posso alzarmi dal letto. il lupo tir\u00f2 il chiavistello ed entr\u00f2 in casa; si diresse in camera della nonnina e in un sol boccone la ingoi\u00f2.", "summary": "After taking a shortcut, the wolf impersonated Little Red Riding Hood to trick the infirm grandmother into letting him in, then devoured her.", "chunk_number": 0}}, {"id": "community-chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Community", "properties": {"name": "Community for Chunk 0", "summary": "After taking a shortcut, the wolf impersonated Little Red Riding Hood to trick the infirm grandmother into letting him in, then devoured her.", "community_type": "contextual"}}], "relationships": [{"id1": "lupo_1", "id2": "casa_nonna_1", "type": "CORSE_A", "properties": {"confidence": 0.95, "description": "The wolf took a shortcut and ran to the grandmother's house.", "weight": 0.95}}, {"id1": "cappuccetto_1", "id2": "strada_lunga_1", "type": "PROSEGUIVA_PER", "properties": {"confidence": 0.95, "description": "Little Red Riding Hood continued along the longer road.", "weight": 0.95}}, {"id1": "cappuccetto_1", "id2": "nocciole_1", "type": "RACCOGLIENDO", "properties": {"confidence": 0.95, "