{"batch_id": "fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c", "chunk_number": 0, "extracted_graph_data": {"entities": [{"id": "wolf_01", "type": "Character", "name": "lupo", "properties": {"description": "The antagonist of the story, who disguises himself as the grandmother.", "role": "Antagonist"}}, {"id": "lrrh_01", "type": "Character", "name": "cappuccetto rosso", "properties": {"description": "The protagonist of the story, Little Red Riding Hood.", "role": "Protagonist"}}, {"id": "grandma_01", "type": "Character", "name": "nonna", "properties": {"description": "Little Red Riding Hood's grandmother, whose identity is impersonated by the wolf.", "role": "Original character"}}, {"id": "cap_01", "type": "Clothing", "name": "cuffia", "properties": {"description": "A cap typically worn by the grandmother."}}, {"id": "nightgown_01", "type": "Clothing", "name": "camicia da notte", "properties": {"description": "A nightgown typically worn by the grandmother."}}, {"id": "door_01", "type": "Object", "name": "porta", "properties": {"description": "The entrance to the grandmother's house or room."}}, {"id": "focaccia_01", "type": "Food", "name": "focaccia", "properties": {"description": "A type of Italian bread, brought by Little Red Riding Hood as a gift."}}, {"id": "juice_bottle_01", "type": "Object", "name": "bottiglia di succo", "properties": {"description": "A bottle containing juice, brought by Little Red Riding Hood as a gift."}}, {"id": "latch_01", "type": "Object", "name": "catenaccio", "properties": {"description": "A locking mechanism on the door."}}, {"id": "grandma_room_01", "type": "Location", "name": "camera della nonna", "properties": {"description": "The bedroom belonging to the grandmother."}}, {"id": "bed_01", "type": "Furniture", "name": "letto", "properties": {"description": "The bed in the grandmother's room, where the wolf is hiding."}}, {"id": "ears_01", "type": "BodyPart", "name": "orecchie", "properties": {"description": "The wolf's ears, which are perceived as unusually large by Little Red Riding Hood.", "size": "large", "stated_purpose_by_wolf": "to hear you better"}}, {"id": "eyes_01", "type": "BodyPart", "name": "occhi", "properties": {"description": "The wolf's eyes, which are perceived as unusually large by Little Red Riding Hood.", "size": "large", "stated_purpose_by_wolf": "to see you better"}}, {"id": "hands_01", "type": "BodyPart", "name": "mani", "properties": {"description": "The wolf's hands, which are perceived as unusually large by Little Red Riding Hood.", "size": "large", "stated_purpose_by_wolf": "to caress you better"}}, {"id": "mouth_01", "type": "BodyPart", "name": "bocca", "properties": {"description": "The wolf's mouth, which is perceived as unusually large by Little Red Riding Hood.", "size": "large"}}, {"id": "cold_01", "type": "Condition", "name": "raffreddata", "properties": {"description": "The condition of having a cold."}}, {"id": "chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Chunk", "properties": {"original_text": "quindi richiuse la porta, indoss\u00f2 la cuffia e la camicia da notte della nonna e si mise a letto, aspettando l\u02bcarrivo di cappuccetto rosso che, poco dopo, buss\u00f2 alla porta: \u00abtoc toc!\u00bb \u2013 chi \u00e8? \u2013 rispose il lupo. cappuccetto si accorse subito della strana voce della nonna, ma credendo che fosse raffreddata rispose: \u2013 sono io nonnina, cappuccetto rosso. ti ho portato una focaccia e una bottiglia di succo, apri la porta! \u2013 tira il catenaccio e la porta si aprir\u00e0 \u2013 grid\u00f2 il lupo. tirato il catenaccio la porta si apr\u00ec e, cappuccetto rosso, si diresse in camera della nonna. quando si avvicin\u00f2 al letto cappuccetto rimase molto meravigliata nel vedere lo strano aspetto della sua nonnina. allora le disse: \u2013 oh, nonna, che orecchie grosse che hai! \u2013 \u00e8 per sentirti meglio, piccina mia. \u2013 oh, nonna, che occhi grandi che hai! \u2013 \u00e8 per vederti meglio, piccina mia. \u2013 oh, nonna, che grosse mani che hai! \u2013 \u00e8 per accarezzarti meglio, piccina mia. \u2013 ma, nonna, che bocca grande che hai!", "summary": "Disguised as Grandma, the wolf lets Little Red Riding Hood in, who then questions its unusually large features.", "chunk_number": 0}}, {"id": "community-chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Community", "properties": {"name": "Community for Chunk 0", "summary": "Disguised as Grandma, the wolf lets Little Red Riding Hood in, who then questions its unusually large features.", "community_type": "contextual"}}], "relationships": [{"source": "wolf_01", "target": "cap_01", "type": "INDOSS\u00d2", "properties": {"confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "wolf_01", "target": "nightgown_01", "type": "INDOSS\u00d2", "properties": {"confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "cap_01", "target": "grandma_01", "type": "APPARTENENTE_A", "properties": {"confidence": 0.95, "weight": 0.95}}, {"source": "nightgown_01", "target": "grandma_01", "type": "APPARTENENTE_A", "properties": {"confidence": 0.95, "weight": 0.95}}, {"source": "wolf_01", "target": "bed_01", "type": "SI_MISE_A", "properties": {"confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "lrrh_01", "target": "door_01", "type": "BUSS\u00d2_A", "properties": {"confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "wolf_01", "target": "lrrh_01", "type": "RISPOSE_A", "properties": {"confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "lrrh_01", "target": "wolf_01", "type": "PERCEP\u00cc_VOCE_DI", "properties": {"description": "Little Red Riding Hood perceived the wolf's voice as strange and belonging to the grandmother.", "confidence": 1.0, "weight": 1.0}}, {"source": "lrrh_01", "target": "grandma_01", "type": "ATTRIBU\u00cc_CONDIZIONE", "properties": {"condition": "cold_01", "description": "Little Red Riding Hood believed the grandmother was suffering from a cold.", "confidence": 0.9, "weight": 0.9}}, 