{"batch_id": "fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c", "chunk_number": 0, "extracted_graph_data": {"entities": [{"id": "lupo_1", "type": "Animal", "name": "lupo", "properties": {"description": "The wolf from the fairy tale, initially sleeping in grandma's bed and later filled with stones, resulting in its demise in the well.", "characteristics": ["evil"], "initial_state": "satiated and asleep", "final_state": "dead in well"}}, {"id": "cacciatore_1", "type": "Person", "name": "cacciatore", "properties": {"description": "A hunter who discovers the wolf and saves Little Red Riding Hood and her grandmother.", "role": "savior"}}, {"id": "nonna_1", "type": "Person", "name": "nonna", "properties": {"description": "The grandmother, found in the wolf's belly and rescued.", "state": "safe and sound"}}, {"id": "cappuccetto_rosso_1", "type": "Person", "name": "cappuccetto rosso", "properties": {"description": "Little Red Riding Hood, rescued from the wolf's belly and responsible for filling the wolf with stones.", "state": "safe and sound", "learned_lesson": true}}, {"id": "forbici_1", "type": "Object", "name": "forbici", "properties": {"description": "A pair of scissors used by the hunter to cut open the wolf.", "purpose": "cutting"}}, {"id": "pietre_1", "type": "Object", "name": "pietre", "properties": {"description": "Stones collected by Little Red Riding Hood to weigh down the wolf.", "characteristics": ["heavy"]}}, {"id": "letto_1", "type": "Object", "name": "letto", "properties": {"description": "The bed where the wolf was sleeping."}}, {"id": "stanza_1", "type": "Location", "name": "stanza", "properties": {"description": "The room where the wolf and bed were located."}}, {"id": "pozzo_1", "type": "Location", "name": "pozzo", "properties": {"description": "A well located outside the house."}}, {"id": "casa_1", "type": "Location", "name": "casa", "properties": {"description": "The house where the grandmother lives and the events unfold."}}, {"id": "mamma_1", "type": "Person", "name": "mamma", "properties": {"description": "Little Red Riding Hood's mother, whose advice she should follow."}}, {"id": "rumore_1", "type": "Concept", "name": "rumore", "properties": {"description": "The loud snoring sound made by the wolf.", "characteristics": ["very loud"]}}, {"id": "sete_1", "type": "Concept", "name": "sete", "properties": {"description": "The feeling of thirst experienced by the wolf after waking up.", "intensity": "great"}}, {"id": "lezione_1", "type": "Concept", "name": "lezione", "properties": {"description": "The moral or lesson learned by Little Red Riding Hood.", "content": "not to disobey mother and not to talk to a wolf"}}, {"id": "chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Chunk", "properties": {"original_text": "saziato il suo appetito, si rimise poi a letto, s'addorment\u00f2 e cominci\u00f2 a russare molto forte. proprio allora pass\u00f2 l\u00ec davanti un cacciatore e pens\u00f2: \u2013 che cos\u02bc\u00e8 questo rumore? sar\u00e0 meglio entrare a dare un\u02bcocchiata, la nonnina potrebbe star male. entr\u00f2 nella stanza e, avvicinatosi al letto, vide il lupo. \u2013 ecco che cos\u02bcera quel rumore! \u2013 esclam\u00f2 il cacciatore \u2013 finalmente ti ho trovato, brutto malvagio, \u00e8 un pezzo che ti cerco! cos\u00ec prese un paio di forbici e cominci\u00f2 a tagliare la pancia del lupo addormentato: in un attimo, cappuccetto rosso e la nonna uscirono fuori sane e salve. cappuccetto quindi corse fuori a prendere delle pietre e ci riemp\u00ec la pancia del lupo. quando egli si svegli\u00f2 sent\u00ec una gran sete, allora si diresse verso il pozzo all\u02bcesterno della casa, ma quando si sporse per bere le pietre erano cos\u00ec pesanti che cadde nel pozzo. da quel giorno cappuccetto rosso impar\u00f2 la lezione, non disubbidire alla mamma e soprattutto non parlare con un lupo! riad.", "summary": "A hunter rescues Red Riding Hood and her grandmother from inside the wolf, who then drowns after Red Riding Hood fills him with stones, teaching her a lesson about obedience.", "chunk_number": 0}}, {"id": "community-chunk-fe595147a4851c99fd4917e6a8837b8e65ae962fd25a2f1148ba6b511f28969c-0", "type": "Community", "properties": {"name": "Community for Chunk 0", "summary": "A hunter rescues Red Riding Hood and her grandmother from inside the wolf, who then drowns after Red Riding Hood fills him with stones, teaching her a lesson about obedience.", "community_type": "contextual"}}], "relationships": [{"id": "rel1", "source": "lupo_1", "target": "letto_1", "type": "SI_RIMISE_A", "properties": {"description": "The wolf went back to bed.", "confidence": 0.95, "weight": 0.95}}, {"id": "rel2", "source": "lupo_1", "target": "rumore_1", "type": "PRODUCE", "properties": {"description": "The wolf started snoring loudly, producing a noise.", "confidence": 0.9, "action": "snoring", "weight": 0.9}}, {"id": "rel3", "source": "cacciatore_1", "target": "stanza_1", "type": "PASS\u00d2_DAVANTI", "properties": {"description": "The hunter passed in front of the room (where the noise came from).", "confidence": 0.85, "weight": 0.85}}, {"id": "rel4", "source": "cacciatore_1", "target": "rumore_1", "type": "CONSIDERA", "properties": {"description": "The hunter considered the noise.", "thought": "che cos'\u00e8 questo rumore?", "confidence": 0.9, "weight": 0.9}}, {"id": "rel5", "source": "cacciatore_1", "target": "nonna_1", "type": "CONSIDERA", "properties": {"description": "The hunter considered Grandma's well-being.", "thought": "la nonnina potrebbe star male", "confidence": 0.9, "weight": 0.9}}, {"id": "rel6", "source": "cacciatore_1", "target": "stanza_1", "type": "ENTR\u00d2_IN", "properties": {"description": "The hunter entered the room.", "confidence": 0.95, "weight": 0.95}}, {"id": "rel7", "source": "cacciatore_1", "target": "letto_1", "type": "SI_AVVICIN\u00d2_A", "properties": {"description": "The hunter approached the bed.", "confiden